<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Kopi Senja | Premium Restaurant & Coffee</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root { --coffee-dark: #2C1E16; --coffee-light: #D4A373; --cream: #FAEDCD; --text: #333; --white: #ffffff; }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background-color: var(--cream); color: var(--text); overflow-x: hidden; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }

        /* NAVBAR */
        nav { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 20px 40px; background-color: rgba(44, 30, 22, 0.95); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); color: var(--cream); position: fixed; width: 100%; top: 0; z-index: 100; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); }
        .logo { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1px; }
        .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 25px; align-items: center; }
        .nav-links a { color: var(--cream); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; font-size: 0.9rem; transition: 0.3s; }
        .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--coffee-light); }
        .btn-pesan-nav { border: 1px solid var(--coffee-light); padding: 8px 20px; border-radius: 50px; transition: 0.3s; }
        .btn-pesan-nav:hover { background: var(--coffee-light); color: var(--coffee-dark) !important; }
        .menu-btn { display: none; font-size: 28px; cursor: pointer; }

        /* HERO SECTION */
        .hero { height: 65vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center; text-align: center; background: linear-gradient(rgba(44, 30, 22, 0.6), rgba(44, 30, 22, 0.8)), url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1497935586351-b67a49e012bf?q=80&w=1500&auto=format&fit=crop') center/cover fixed; color: var(--cream); padding: 20px; margin-top: 70px; }
        .hero h1 { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem); margin-bottom: 15px; text-shadow: 2px 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); }
        .hero p { font-size: 1.1rem; max-width: 600px; margin-bottom: 30px; text-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.8); font-weight: 300; }
        .btn-hero { padding: 14px 35px; background-color: var(--coffee-light); color: var(--coffee-dark); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; border-radius: 50px; font-size: 1rem; transition: 0.3s; }
        .btn-hero:hover { background-color: #b5835a; transform: translateY(-2px); }

        /* MENU SECTION */
        .menu-section { padding: 80px 20px; max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; }
        .category-title { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 2rem; color: var(--coffee-dark); margin: 50px 0 25px; text-align: center; position: relative; }
        .category-title::after { content: ''; display: block; width: 60px; height: 2px; background: var(--coffee-light); margin: 10px auto 0; }
        
        /* GRID MENU */
        .menu-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 30px; }
        
        .menu-item { background: var(--white); border-radius: 16px; padding: 20px; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.04); display: flex; flex-direction: column; transition: all 0.3s ease; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.03); }
        .menu-item:hover { transform: translateY(-8px); box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
        .menu-item img { width: 100%; height: 200px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
        .menu-item h3 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--coffee-dark); font-weight: 600; }
        .menu-item p { color: #777; font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 20px; flex-grow: 1; line-height: 1.5; }
        
        .item-footer { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-top: auto; padding-top: 15px; border-top: 1px solid #f0f0f0; }
        .price { font-weight: 700; color: var(--coffee-dark); font-size: 1.1rem; }
        .btn-order { background: var(--coffee-dark); color: var(--cream); padding: 8px 18px; border-radius: 50px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600; transition: 0.3s; }
        .btn-order:hover { background: var(--coffee-light); color: var(--coffee-dark); }

        /* FOOTER */
        footer { background-color: var(--coffee-dark); color: var(--cream); text-align: center; padding: 50px 20px; margin-top: 60px; }
        footer p { font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 10px; opacity: 0.8; }
        footer a { color: var(--coffee-light); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; }

        /* RESPONSIVE */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            nav { padding: 15px 20px; }
            .menu-btn { display: block; }
            .nav-links { display: none; flex-direction: column; position: absolute; top: 65px; left: 0; width: 100%; background-color: var(--coffee-dark); padding: 20px; gap: 15px; }
            .nav-links.active { display: flex; }
            .hero h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; }
            .menu-section { padding: 40px 15px; }
            .category-title { font-size: 1.6rem; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <nav>
        <div class="logo">Kopi Senja.</div>
        <div class="menu-btn" onclick="toggleMobileMenu()">☰</div>
        <div class="nav-links" id="mobileMenu">
            <!-- Tombol kembali ke Agensi -->
            <a href="index.html">← Back to Portfolio</a>
            <a href="pemesanan.html" class="btn-pesan-nav">Pesan Sekarang</a>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <section class="hero">
        <h1>Secangkir Kehangatan di Setiap Senja.</h1>
        <p>Dari hidangan utama yang mengenyangkan hingga kopi premium untuk menemani ceritamu.</p>
        <a href="#menu" class="btn-hero">Lihat Menu Kami</a>
    </section>

    <div class="menu-section" id="menu">
        
        <!-- KATEGORI 1: MAIN COURSE -->
        <h2 class="category-title">Main Course</h2>
        <div class="menu-grid">
            <div class="menu-item">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1550547660-d9450f859349?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Burger">
                <h3>Beef Burger</h3>
                <p>Patty sapi premium, keju, dan sayuran segar.</p>
                <div class="item-footer"><span class="price">Rp 45.000</span><a href="pemesanan.html" class="btn-order">Pesan</a></div>
            </div>
            <div class="menu-item">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551183053-bf91a1d81141?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Spaghetti">
                <h3>Spaghetti Bolognese</h3>
                <p>Pasta dengan saus daging sapi dan tomat segar.</p>
                <div class="item-footer"><span class="price">Rp 40.000</span><a href="pemesanan.html" class="btn-order">Pesan</a></div>
            </div>
            <div class="menu-item">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1604908176997-125f25cc6f3d?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Chicken Steak">
                <h3>Chicken Steak</h3>
                <p>Ayam panggang dengan saus lada hitam.</p>
                <div class="item-footer"><span class="price">Rp 38.000</span><a href="pemesanan.html" class="btn-order">Pesan</a></div>
            </div>
            <div class="menu-item">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1565299624946-b28f40a0ae38?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Pizza">
                <h3>Pepperoni Pizza</h3>
                <p>Pizza dengan keju mozzarella dan pepperoni.</p>
                <div class="item-footer"><span class="price">Rp 55.000</span><a href="pemesanan.html" class="btn-order">Pesan</a></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- KATEGORI 2: COFFEE -->
        <h2 class="category-title">Coffee Series</h2>
        <div class="menu-grid">
            <div class="menu-item">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1541167760496-1628856ab772?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Es Kopi Senja">
                <h3>Es Kopi Senja</h3>
                <p>Espresso double shot, susu segar, gula aren.</p>
                <div class="item-footer"><span class="price">Rp 22.000</span><a href="pemesanan.html" class="btn-order">Pesan</a></div>
            </div>
            <div class="menu-item">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1509042239860-f550ce710b93?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Americano">
                <h3>Americano Panas</h3>
                <p>Kopi hitam murni Arabika Gayo.</p>
                <div class="item-footer"><span class="price">Rp 18.000</span><a href="pemesanan.html" class="btn-order">Pesan</a></div>
            </div>
            <div class="menu-item">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572442388796-11668a67e53d?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Cappuccino">
                <h3>Cappuccino</h3>
                <p>Espresso dengan busa susu lembut.</p>
                <div class="item-footer"><span class="price">Rp 25.000</span><a href="pemesanan.html" class="btn-order">Pesan</a></div>
            </div>
            <div class="menu-item">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1497935586351-b67a49e012bf?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Latte">
                <h3>Caffe Latte</h3>
                <p>Espresso dengan susu steamed yang creamy.</p>
                <div class="item-footer"><span class="price">Rp 25.000</span><a href="pemesanan.html" class="btn-order">Pesan</a></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- KATEGORI 3: NON-COFFEE -->
        <h2 class="category-title">Non-Coffee & Refreshers</h2>
        <div class="menu-grid">
            <div class="menu-item">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1513558161293-cdaf765ed2fd?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Matcha">
                <h3>Matcha Latte</h3>
                <p>Matcha premium dengan susu creamy.</p>
                <div class="item-footer"><span class="price">Rp 24.000</span><a href="pemesanan.html" class="btn-order">Pesan</a></div>
            </div>
            <div class="menu-item">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1513558161293-cdaf765ed2fd?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Lemon Tea">
                <h3>Lemon Tea</h3>
                <p>Teh hitam dingin dengan irisan lemon segar.</p>
                <div class="item-footer"><span class="price">Rp 15.000</span><a href="pemesanan.html" class="btn-order">Pesan</a></div>
            </div>
            <div class="menu-item">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544145945-f90425340c7e?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Mocktail">
                <h3>Blue Ocean Mocktail</h3>
                <p>Minuman soda biru menyegarkan dengan lemon.</p>
                <div class="item-footer"><span class="price">Rp 28.000</span><a href="pemesanan.html" class="btn-order">Pesan</a></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- KATEGORI 4: SNACK & DESSERT -->
        <h2 class="category-title">Snack & Dessert</h2>
        <div class="menu-grid">
            <div class="menu-item">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555507036-ab1f4038808a?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Croissant">
                <h3>Butter Croissant</h3>
                <p>Pastry renyah berlapis mentega premium.</p>
                <div class="item-footer"><span class="price">Rp 25.000</span><a href="pemesanan.html" class="btn-order">Pesan</a></div>
            </div>
            <!-- GAMBAR FRENCH FRIES YANG BENAR -->
            <div class="menu-item">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1573080496219-bb080dd4f877?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="French Fries">
                <h3>French Fries</h3>
                <p>Kentang goreng renyah dengan saus spesial.</p>
                <div class="item-footer"><span class="price">Rp 20.000</span><a href="pemesanan.html" class="btn-order">Pesan</a></div>
            </div>
            <div class="menu-item">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1563805042-7684c8e9e999?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Ice Cream">
                <h3>Vanilla Ice Cream</h3>
                <p>Es krim vanila lembut dengan topping oreo.</p>
                <div class="item-footer"><span class="price">Rp 18.000</span><a href="pemesanan.html" class="btn-order">Pesan</a></div>
            </div>
            <div class="menu-item">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1606313564200-e75d5e30476c?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Cake">
                <h3>Chocolate Fudge Cake</h3>
                <p>Kue coklat pekat dengan saus fudge hangat.</p>
                <div class="item-footer"><span class="price">Rp 30.000</span><a href="pemesanan.html" class="btn-order">Pesan</a></div>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 Kopi Senja. All rights reserved.</p>
        <p style="font-size: 0.8rem; opacity: 0.6;">Website designed by <a href="index.html">Frost & Hog Cyber Team</a></p>
    </footer>

    <script>
        function toggleMobileMenu() {
            document.getElementById('mobileMenu').classList.toggle('active');
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
